### ============================================================================
### 💍 SINDHI MATRIMONY BACKEND - INTERACTIVE REST CLIENT COLLECTION
### ============================================================================
### Use this file with VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client.
### 
### Quick Start Instructions:
### 1. Ensure backend is running: npm run dev (runs on http://localhost:5000)
### 2. Hit "Health Check" below to verify connectivity.
### 3. Hit "Send OTP" or "Verify OTP / Login" with master OTP 1234.
### 4. Copy the "token" from response and paste it into @authToken below.
### ============================================================================

### Base URLs:
### 1. Local Development (Port 5001)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001/api/v1
### 2. Vercel Live Production
