### 9. REAL-TIME CHAT & CONTACT VIEW MODULE
### ============================================================================

### 9.1 View / Unlock Candidate Verified Phone & WhatsApp (Deducts 1 Credit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/members/view-contact/{{candidateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 9.2 Check Remaining Contact View Credits
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile/contact-credits
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 9.3 Check User Chat Quota Status (5 Free Trial Messages vs Paid Unlimited Plan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/quota-status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 9.4 Get Active Chat Conversations List
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 9.5 Start or Open 1-on-1 Conversation with Candidate
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientProfileId": "67b34a12c8e312a0f9000004"
}

### 9.6 Get Message History in Conversation (Cursor Pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/messages/{{conversationId}}?limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 9.7 Send Chat Message (Validates Trial Quota: Free user = 5 msgs max, Paid = Unlimited direct chat)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}",
  "recipientProfileId": "67b34a12c8e312a0f9000004",
  "text": "Jai Jhulelal! Glad to connect with your profile on Sindhi Matrimony.",
  "messageType": "TEXT"
}

### 9.8 Mark Messages in Conversation as Read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/chat/messages/read
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}"
}

